keywords:
  - Connes rigidity
  - Ioana
  - operator algebras
  - Quantyra
  - Nielsen
abstract: >-
  Bounded public report: Nielsen's application of Ioana's Theorem 8.2
  (JAMS 2011) to the twisted comultiplication Θ fails because hypothesis
  (2) is violated by the by-construction containment im(Θ) ⊆ A_G ⊗̄ L(H).
  Does not prove or refute Connes rigidity and does not settle OpenAI or
  Zhou counterexamples. Companion Lean tag v0.1.1-obstruction
  (DOI 10.5281/zenodo.21859309). Version DOI 10.5281/zenodo.21859308;
  concept DOI 10.5281/zenodo.21845586.
